    '<span>Occupancy cost ' + pct(t.ocr) + ' · growth ' + sg(t.growth) + ' (' + S.W + 'M)</span><span>Sales $' + Math.round(t.wPsf) + '/sf · rent $' + t.rent.toFixed(2) + '/sf</span>' +
